WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.350
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.380
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.950
Communication!

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.820
As we measure your growth in the next Special Audition,

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.330
keep this important keyword in mind, everyhoney.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.700
Communication...

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.430
Moreover, we're welcoming team entries for this audition!

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.460
You can form your teams however you want!

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:32.500
Those who pass this audition will receive the Mastery of Communication!

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.470
If you get it, say "woo"!

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.890
Woo!

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.260
That's right!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:41.280
That's a key facet of communication: call and response.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.350
Starmiya!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.350
Call and lettuce ponzu?

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:25.950
Not lettuce ponzu, response.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.080
Res... ponse?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.520
It's the same word as when you return someone's text message.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:35.460
You responded when Johnny-sensei called out.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.840
Ohh.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:39.360
It's also what you see during live broadcasts of idol performances.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.070
It's when the idols say "Everyone having fun?"

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.810
and the audience goes "Yeah!"

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:48.030
That back and forth between performers and the people watching is what we name "call and response".

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.150
So that's it.

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:50.850
Ichigo-tan!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.310
Otome-chan.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.640
Let's take the audition together!

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.320
I don't mind doing it with you all.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.720
This song is perfect.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:11.460
"Growing for a dream".

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:14.480
Nothing gets fans more excited than the third verse of this song.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.610
Ichigo-sama.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:16.590
Sakura-chan!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.710
Morning.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:22.250
Ichigo-sama, as well as everyone else, good luck in the Special Audition.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.470
I'll be cheering you on from the sidelines.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.640
Huh, you're not entering?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.230
I don't believe I'm ready yet.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.230
But they said that first-years could enter too.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:35.980
My first-year is entering with two of her friends, you know.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.360
That sounds nice.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.990
Sakura-chan, why don't you join us?

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:45.230
But, but, but! I couldn't possibly intrude upon an upperclassmen group.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:49.120
I haven't had enough practice yet, and moreover...

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.120
Moreover?

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.920
No, well...

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.380
I don't have any Premium Rare cards... {only because I couldn't decide whether to capitalize dress}

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:58.090
You never know what'll happen if you don't try.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:02.630
The first thing you need to do to get Premium cards is meet the designer.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:03.890
I'll support you.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:07.640
But then I'll be a burden on your audition preparations...

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.470
No objections here! It only feels right that you join us. {don't think it's necessarily "fate" and that sounds a little awkward}

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:12.890
And anyway, I want to be with you, Sakura-chan.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.230
I agree.

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.730
I suppose I won't mind not disallowing you to join us.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.960
Yurika-sama's in too.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.500
Sakura's the one and only super rookie. {is this appropriate?}

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.910
I'm sure we'll be able to learn from her too.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:31.560
Me too! I want to perform with Sakura-tan too!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:32.960
Love you!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:33.870
But...

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:39.030
We have an obligation to pass on the favors all our senpai have done for us. {I'm okay with pluralizing "senpai" with an s, are you?}{the -> our, no s}

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.130
That's right!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.010
And now that that's decided...

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.580
It's time to pick out a brand for Sakura-chan!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:45.830
Da-da-dun! {or other appropriate sound effect}

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.080
What?!

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:55.100
I recommend Angely Sugar.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:59.880
Look at how cute it makes Sakura-chan.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.820
I-I suppose...

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.110
No, no.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.370
The mismatch between the traditional Sakura-chan and Futuring Girl is way more exciting.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.550
That looks good too!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.120
Um, I...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.620
If you want clothes with history, go Loli Gothic.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.850
Try this Striped Gothic coord.

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:17.000
It's great!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.250
Or try a mature look with Spicy Ageha.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.260
Happy Rainbow's the way to go!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:29.800
Well... I think all of your suggestions are wonderful,

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.140
but I already...

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.500
So none of them really caught your fancy.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.350
Looks like it.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.570
No, I...

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.900
Oh yeah!

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:41.900
Here it is!

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.360
"Hinoki Theater Special New Year's Edition".

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.560
Oh my! {not letting us do that}

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.110
What's that?

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.280
It's a magazine detailing things from all of theater based entertainment, right?

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.160
Your area of expertise is really wide, Aoi.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.040
I won't let a single snippet of idol info escape.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.880
The special article is an interview with the Kitaouji family.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.670
Check it out, there's even an interview with Sakura-chan.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:06.690
"Though I was raised in a house of kabuki actors

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.510
it is not as though I always wear a kimono.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:15.180
For instance, I have been a big fan of Aurora Fantasy dresses ever since elementary school..."

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.970
Sakura-chan, so you like Aurora Fantasy!

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.740
These cards are precious to me.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:34.870
So this is an Aurora Fantasy dress.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.320
I've never seen them before.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.180
Same here.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.370
Love you!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:45.350
Aurora Fantasy makes dresses that seem like they were taken straight out of a fairy tale.

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.880
The design motifs include wildflowers, fairies, and ivy, {it was just awkward having the split there}

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:52.390
as well as other natural elements from forests, {natural silvan elements?}

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.510
and are also highly regarded as theatrical outfits.

00:06:56.190 --> 00:07:01.000
The top designer Green Grass-sama was originally a picture book author.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.190
A picture book author... {or illustrator}

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.880
Ever since I was a child,

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.340
I've loved this picture book by Green Grass-sama.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:13.200
I lost myself in its pages almost every day.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.830
All of Green Grass's personal information is shrouded in mystery.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:24.590
Especially after Green Grass became Aurora Fantasy's top designer, that info became top secret. {avoiding saying 'her'}

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.590
I've read that only a handful of people know anything at all.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.430
Don't worry!

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:35.170
We'll help you out, and I'm sure we can find them if we ask Johnny-sensei and the Headmistress.

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.350
That's not the problem, Ichigo-sama.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.100
It isn't?

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.990
Aurora Fantasy's dresses don't suit me very well.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.310
I'm sure I won't be allowed a Premium Dress. {hmm, capitalize dress or not}

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:52.110
Even so, I will not wear any other brand's dresses.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:58.490
That's why it is impossible for me to participate in this audition with the rest of you.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.160
Sakura-chan...

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.570
Thank you very much for attempting to assist me.

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.960
Please do your best in the audition.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:13.970
I wonder why Sakura-chan doesn't think those dresses suit her?

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.470
I'm sure they'd look great on her...

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:19.660
There's no way of knowing unless we ask Sakura directly.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:23.740
I feel like I've hurt Sakura-chan's feelings.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.150
It's not your fault!

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.470
Sakura-tan's love for Aurora Fantasy is big! {eh...}

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:35.660
I'm going to go see Happy Rainbow's top designer Makoto-san right now!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.700
Otome-chan!

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.930
What does she even plan on doing?

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:43.130
Anyway, we need to do something about Sakura.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:51.250
Sakura-chan is holding herself back just because she doesn't have a Premium Dress.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.320
Even though she really wants to join us?

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.220
It simplifies things if that's the case.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.180
All we have to do is not use Premium Dresses either.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.580
Right?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.480
Yeah.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.350
Then let's start preparing.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:09.100
I'll write up a rehearsal schedule and send it to you all later.

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:15.280
Yurika-sama won't not divide the lyrics up and prepare the stage choreography.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.860
We all know the song already,

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.200
so let's practice the song and the dance on our own.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.400
Got it.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:26.780
I already asked Johnny-sensei, but I'm going to do a bit more research on Green Grass-san on my own.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:27.750
Aoi.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.720
We can't let Sakura go on for much longer without getting a Premium Dress.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.010
To idols, Premium cards are also life itself. {because this is kinda silly}

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.590
Thanks, everyone!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.640
I'll try talking to Sakura-chan one more time.

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:44.140
Daughter of a famous kabuki family, Kitaouji Sakura.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:47.260
She'll be undergoing a significant transformation soon.

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:51.610
Let's believe that Hoshimiya's team will create a scientific change in her.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.680
Headmistress, that's chemistry, right?

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:58.530
And by the way, should I make the call to Aurora Fantasy's top designer?

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:01.210
Let's leave that to the students.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:04.110
They should be able to take care of it with good teamwork.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.850
Onii-sama? Hello.

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:12.930
Sakura?

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:17.760
Has something happened? I believe I asked you not to call me.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.390
You sure haven't changed. I'm glad you still sound energetic.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.470
Of course I am! Why wouldn't I be energetic...

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.100
Is something wrong?

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:29.010
I've been disrespectful to my seniors...

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:31.490
I'm awful, considering how worried they were.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:36.150
Sakura, they won't be able to understand if you don't tell them properly.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.280
They don't know you like I do.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.280
I know that.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.780
Be more honest.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.560
Yes...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.370
Green Grass, Green Grass...

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.670
I can't find a single thing.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.420
Can they turn invisible or something?{...} {I guess it's not necessarily a reference...}

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.550
They must either really dislike the media or be bad at dealing with people.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.050
Sakura-chan seemed really hurt.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:10.200
Like she was screaming for help inside her but couldn't put it into words?

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.310
Yeah!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:16.940
That's exactly it! If we could just find out why, we might be able to help Sakura-chan!

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.160
Sakura-chan!

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:34.790
Good morning!

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:37.970
Good morning, Ichigo-sama.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:41.180
I'm terribly sorry about the rude things I said yesterday.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:43.490
Don't worry, you weren't rude at all.

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:46.310
But anyway, I read Green Grass's picture book!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.210
It was a really wonderful story.

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:49.000
Thank you.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.300
And now I've got a question for you.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:57.340
Why do you keep insisting that 
Aurora Fantasy dresses don't suit you?

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.690
That's...

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.570
Be more honest.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.770
Ah, it's the Kitaouji Theater!

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:10.620
A tale that brings tears both to speaker and listener.

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:15.440
When the younger twin Sakura's older brother Sakon began his training,

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.630
her time alone grew as long as the evening shadow.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.200
To combat that loneliness,

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:26.700
the girl became engrossed in reading her beloved Green Grass-sama's picture book.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:31.480
"Where, where? Where have you disappeared to, Princess?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:37.110
The fairies made a necklace from beads of morning dew,

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.150
and knitted a matching dress from the sparkles of the shining lake."

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:46.160
In time, the world of the picture book became Sakura's home.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.620
However...

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.120
"The morning after the stardust fell.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:56.740
A prince appeared before the beautifully adorned princess.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.000
Let us set out for the theater.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.940
The two of them traveled the path to the heavens,

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.590
dancing all the way."

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.220
She escaped the chains of her home

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.160
and came to the shining academy.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.970
But in the end she remains a kabuki actor.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:22.570
It was but an unfulfillable fantasy.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:27.760
I sent Green Grass-sama letters as often as I could.

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.870
But I have yet to receive a single reply...

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.570
So that's how it was.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:36.320
I'm sure that I just don't fit the brand's image.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.920
That's no good, Sakura-chan!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:41.550
You can't give up before you've even met Green Grass-san!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:46.440
Aoi stayed up all night looking for clues about how we could find Green Grass-san.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.760
Ran and Yurika-chan are busy 
preparing for the performance. {are we using live? though she doesn't even say live...}

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.390
Even Otome-chan...

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.890
That's why you can't give up!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:55.370
Ichigo-sama...

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:56.890
I found it!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.300
You okay?

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:02.400
Look at this interview with Makoto-san from Happy Rainbow!

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:06.160
"The top designer of Happy Rainbow, Makoto-san,

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:11.630
is said to be close friends with the top designer of Aurora Fantasy, Green Grass-san."

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:12.160
Ah!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:18.670
It says that he sometimes meets up with 
Green Grass-san to discuss fashion over sweets!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.420
That means that...

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.420
I'm going to go see Makoto-san right now!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.550
Otome-chan might have figured something out!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.050
Hi, this is Otome!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:34.890
Ichigo-tan, good morning!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:39.900
Otome-chan, listen! Sakura-chan has something important to talk to you about.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.960
I have something to talk to Sakura-tan about too.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.280
Oh, hang on, I'll put her on.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.530
This is Sakura.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.910
Otome won't lose to Sakura-tan!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:56.410
I won't let myself lose to the amount of love you have for Aurora Fantasy.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:15:00.280
Otome has a ton of love and gratitude for Happy Rainbow.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:03.790
You made me feel like I had to tell the designer Makoto-san right away!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:06.540
Otome loves Happy Rainbow!

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:10.190
I want to wear a new Premium Dress for the next Special Audition

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:14.560
and spread my love for Happy Rainbow all around the world!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.060
Stop, stop!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:20.630
I've been carefully watching you work hard every day

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:22.940
with your love for Happy Rainbow.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.920
Makoto-san!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.830
This is my yet-unannounced Marble Candy coord.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.800
Use it well.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.540
Love you!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.590
It's like like the dress of the princess of Candyland! {intentional} {why?}

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:48.090
Next is your turn, Sakura-tan.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:53.510
I want to meet the designer of Aurora Fantasy.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:56.070
Could you please ask Makoto-sama about it?

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.330
Aye! I'll ask him now.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.330
That's where Green Grass-sama...

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.040
Want me to come?

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.240
I'm fine.

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:17.970
According to Makoto-sama, 
Green Grass-sama is very shy.

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.090
I need to go alone.

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:24.250
I also need to keep what I see inside a secret.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.970
I'll be going now!

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:27.200
Good luck.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:03.260
Green Grass-sama...

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.030
We've always wanted to meet you, Sakura.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:12.820
We like drawing pictures, but we aren't the best at writing letters.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:18.050
Instead of writing a response, we decided to make you an Aurora Fantasy dress.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.410
Do you like it?

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:27.690
I love both your picture books and Aurora Fantasy's dresses.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:32.320
Now I understand that you have always been by my side.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.250
And from today, forevermore...

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.790
Ichigo-sama!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.090
Sakura-chan, did you meet them?

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:45.710
Yes!

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:49.150
I received the Premium Rare Blooming Coord cards!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.820
Straight out of a fairy tale!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.840
Your feelings really <i>did</i> reach them.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:55.980
They did!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.260
Call and response!

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:03.530
Here we go!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:05.100
Yeah!

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.760
Everyone!

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:02.400
Thanks for always supporting us in our Aikatsu!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:08.780
Now then, it's time to introduce our new rising star!

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.630
Kitaouji Sakura-chan!

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:12.890
I'm Kitaouji Sakura!

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:16.420
Do I look good in this Aurora Fantasy dress?

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.620
Everyone, that makes me truly happy!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:24.950
Thank you all so very much!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:57.620
Hoshimiya Ichigo, I see you've raised another rival.

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:02.030
Oh my honey god! {I... uh...} {...}

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.690
Good job, me!

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:06.950
Wipe your nose, it's unbecoming.

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:11.760
You all pass the Special Audition.

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:18.040
Communication is the art of playing catch with words.

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:22.450
You must start from learning how to properly accept the ball your partner throws.

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:00.990
What did you think of call and response?

00:24:00.990 --> 00:24:04.360
I felt like I worked with the audience to complete the performance!

00:24:04.360 --> 00:24:07.460
When they get fired up, you can't help but get excited too!

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:09.920
Unify through performances!

00:24:10.430 --> 00:24:12.380
What's the next audition's song?

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:14.810
It's the legendary idols, Masquerade's signature song!

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:17.960
As such, let's try doing some old-fashioned training!

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:18.810
Huh?

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:20.130
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.130 --> 00:24:21.590
An idol on Mother's Day!

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:23.910
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
